<title>PAKISTAN: TABLE-KARACHI BOURSE CAPITALISATION RISES IN JULY.</title>
<headline>TABLE-KARACHI BOURSE CAPITALISATION RISES IN JULY.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Karachi Stock Exchange said on Thursday the market capitalisation of its 782 listed firms had risen to 605.276 billion rupees in July from 491.880 billion in June.</p>
<p>						July	 June</p>
<p>Listed capital (in billion rupees)  206.816    206.748</p>
<p>Market capitalisation (in billion)  605.276    491.880</p>
<p>Turnover of shares (in million)   2,562.618    680.007</p>
<p>KSE 100 index  (points)	     1,989.51   1,565.73</p>
<p>KSE all share index (points)	1,288.61   1,056.98</p>
<p>($1 = 40.62 rupees) -- Karachi Newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
